{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-data-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-data","refs":["F-phone-1016"],"severity":"S3","title":"The same routine workout has a different name on different screens and for the gym's trainer","what":"A workout started from a routine and not renamed is saved with no name of its own. The finish screen, the share picture and Health Connect call it by its routine (\"Push 1\"). The exercise page's History tab and the recent workouts sent to the gym's trainer use a second rule that skips the routine and shows the plain day type (\"Full Body\" or \"Push Day\"). One workout, two names.","expected":"Every screen, Health Connect and the trainer's view call the workout by the same name, using one rule: its own name, else its routine's name, else the fallback.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/db/workoutNames.ts:11-23","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/finishSummary.ts:257-260","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/finishSummary.ts:274-279","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/healthConnect.ts:241-243","apps/mobile/src/shop/trainerSync.ts:161-162","apps/mobile/src/tracker/store/activeWorkoutStore.ts:2001-2009"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"three-workout-name-rules","who":"members and gym trainers","how_often":"every routine workout that is not renamed","fix_line":"Make the History tab and the trainer's list use the same naming rule as the finish screen, routine name included","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-phone-tracker-data-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-data","refs":["F-phone-1016"],"severity":"S3","title":"Renaming a saved workout does not change its name in Health Connect","what":"When a member renames a saved workout, the new name is saved on the phone only. The workout is not sent to Health Connect again, so Google Fit and other health apps keep the old name. Editing the workout's sets does resend it; a rename does not.","expected":"A rename also updates the workout in Health Connect, the same way an edit does.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/tracker/db/workoutNames.ts:38-42","apps/mobile/src/app/session/[id].tsx:186-191","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/phoneSync.ts:29-38","apps/mobile/src/tracker/phone/healthConnect.ts:270-275"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"rename-skips-health-connect-resend","who":"members who send workouts to Health Connect","how_often":"every rename","fix_line":"After a rename, send that workout to Health Connect again","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
